{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>בוקה ומבוקה</b> — They are one formation, in the manner of: גאה and גאון, ה' עזי and מעזי." "<b>ומבולקה</b> — Like הנה ה' בוקק הארץ ובולקה. And the meaning of בוקה גם מבולקה: like a desolation Nineveh shall become." "<b>ולב</b> — Every hearer melts." "<b>ופיק ברכים</b> — In the manner of ויפק רצון, but it is somewhat distant. And the correct interpretation: that it is like לפוקה ולמכשול." "<b>וחלחלה</b> — חיל and חילה, doubled." "<b>פארור</b> — I have already explained it."], :book :nahum, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nahum -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nachum"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:38.396477238Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}